  "deferred_source_units": [
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 72:4",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The actual clause concerns no refusal at their death and firmness in scourging. It is not rewritten as painless death or bodily health, and its precise connection remains unsettled.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 72:7",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "Injustice coming out as from fat and passing into a disposition of heart are preserved. A familiar eyes-bulging paraphrase would change the evidence, so no match based on it is retained.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 72:8",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The source says injustice spoken against the height, without explicitly naming that height as God or the Most High. The checked Daniel passage explicitly names the Most High; the uncertain identification is not retained as a supported match.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 72:9",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The mouth set toward heaven and tongue passing over earth form a specific spatial image; general arrogant-speech similarities do not establish a particular counterpart for this whole image.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 72:10",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The returning people, their destination here and their full days remain unclear in this clause. No referents or return event are supplied from another text.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 72:14",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The speaker is scourged all day and rebuked in the mornings. The checked Job passage has morning visitation and judgment for rest, not this precise combination, so the proposal remains pending.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 72:15",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The speaker restrains an account because it would break faith with the generation of God's sons. No independently supported counterpart for that precise restraint and obligation is retained.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 72:17",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "Entering the sanctuary changes understanding of the sinners' last things. Generic sanctuary or judgment language alone has not established a sufficiently particular independent match.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 72:21",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The heart is set ablaze and kidneys altered in the source wording. An imported embittered-heart rendering would replace the evidence, and no secure counterpart for the actual formulation is retained.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 72:25",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The two questions about heaven and desire from God on earth are preserved without rewriting them as a simple declaration that God is the only desire. A sufficiently precise counterpart is unresolved.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 73:5",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "This short unit is the fragment As though into the entrance above. Its attachment to surrounding destruction imagery is retained without manufacturing a full independent proposition or target.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 74:7",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The directions and desert-mountains fragment is preserved as supplied. Promotion or exaltation is not inserted as an absent noun to create a conventional match.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 75:1",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The heading explicitly says concerning the Assyrian, but does not identify a king, battle or date. The checked Assyrian defeat account remains a proposed occasion with no completion credit.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 75:6",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The actual line combines uncomprehending hearts, sleep and men of wealth finding nothing with their hands. It is not converted into a conventional slain-warriors translation.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 75:9",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The earth fears and grows quiet after judgment is heard from heaven. The checked Habakkuk line commands reverence, not silence; the full proposed correspondence is not established.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 75:11",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The verse says human thought will acknowledge God and the remainder of thought will keep a feast for Him. It is not changed to a familiar human-wrath formulation, and the actual thought-and-feast relation remains unresolved.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 76:11",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "Now I have begun and the change of the Most High's right hand are retained. No different translation's anguish or remembrance reading is substituted to resolve the statement.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 77:9",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "Ephraim's archers turn back on a day of war. The checked Chronicles family deaths do not state archery or retreat and do not identify this battle.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "source_reference": "Psalms 77:63",
      "target": null,
      "reason": "The source says fire devoured young men and virgins were not mourned. A familiar virgins-not-married rendering would change the text; no secure independent match for the actual two clauses is retained.",
      "source_unit_read": true,
      "source_and_necessary_context_read": true,
      "completed_source_credit": 0,
      "completed_pair_credit": 0
    },
    {
